From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoBench <neobench@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build: reserve m68k/NeoBench target in stable/15

Reserve m68k as a NeoBench target in the FreeBSD source build system. This
patch is intentionally only the first build hook; the machine-dependent
sources supplied by NeoBench must be installed before a kernel can build.

---
 Makefile.inc1 | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/Makefile.inc1
+++ b/Makefile.inc1
@@ -136,7 +136,8 @@ KNOWN_ARCHES?=\taarch64/arm64 \\
 \t\tpowerpc \\
 \t\tpowerpc64/powerpc \\
 \t\tpowerpc64le/powerpc \\
-\t\triscv64/riscv
+\t\triscv64/riscv \\
+\t\tm68k/m68k
-- 
